OCP is the set of Python bindings for the OpenCascade Technology
(OCCT) 3D modeling kernel used by CadQuery and build123d.  The pybind11
sources are generated by upstream from the OCCT headers with pywrap;
one extension module (OCP) exposes every OCCT package as a submodule
(OCP.gp, OCP.BRepPrimAPI, OCP.STEPControl, ...) plus instantiated
collection templates (OCP.collections).

This is the "novtk" variant (PyPI cadquery-ocp-novtk): the IVtk VTK
visualization bindings are left out.
